            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in the rubygem-activerecord. RubyGem's ActiveRecord is vulnerable to a denial of service caused by a flaw in the PostgreSQL adapter. By sending a specially-crafted request, a remote attacker can cause a slow sequential scan, resulting in a denial of service.",
